Z||000003||btoth||08-05-2001||05:50 PM||||I have a Canon Digital Elph.  $500.  2.1 Megapixels.  I got a 32MB Compact Flash card with it that stores about 48 pictures at 1600x1200 resolution and a USB card reader that works as fast as any other disk drive... no slow uploading from the camera.  Takes great pictures and is so small that I carry it everywhere I go incase I want to take a picture of something I see.||||reg||1
